{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f3a8c21-4b7d-4a1e-b5c8-6d2e3f4a5b6c",
    "name": "IM-APP 后端 · 收藏接口",
    "description": "收藏消息（文字/图片/视频/文件/语音）。\n\n使用说明：\n1) 导入 Apifox：创建项目 → 导入数据 → Postman → 选本文件。\n2) baseUrl 默认正式环境 http://8.210.72.157:8080/api/v1，本机联调可改为 http://localhost:8080/api/v1。\n3) 先跑「0. 登录」获取 token（自动写入 accessToken 变量），后续接口直接可用。\n4) 「2. 收藏列表」会自动把第一条的 favoriteId 写入变量，供「3. 取消收藏」使用。\n5) 演示账号：13800138000 / 123456。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://8.210.72.157:8080/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "favoriteId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 收藏消息",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"messageId\": \"要收藏的消息ID（从会话消息接口获取）\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites",
        "description": "收藏一条消息。\n需要登录态。\n后端会校验消息存在、你是该会话成员、类型支持（text/emoji/image/video/file/voice）。\n重复收藏幂等，返回已有记录。\n\n响应 data：{ id, messageId, type, content, senderId, conversationId, createdAt }"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 收藏列表",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"size\": 20,\n  \"type\": 0\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites/list",
        "description": "查询收藏列表。\n需要登录态。\n\n请求体：\n- page：页码，默认 1\n- size：每页条数，默认 20，最大 100\n- type：收藏类型枚举\n  - 0 = 全部\n  - 1 = 文字（含表情）\n  - 2 = 图片与视频\n  - 3 = 文件\n  - 4 = 语音\n\n会自动把第一条的 favoriteId 写入变量，供接口3使用。"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.code === 0 && json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('favoriteId', json.data[0].id);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. 取消收藏",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{favoriteId}}",
        "description": "取消收藏（仅本人可删）。\n需要登录态。\nfavoriteId 来自接口2自动写入的变量，也可手动填收藏记录 id。"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}